1114 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Our teeth need different vitamins and minerals to fight off cavities. You probably guessed that calcium is a big player here, but there are actually four key nutrients essential to the health of your teeth: calcium and vitamins, K2, D, and A. I do not recommend blind supplementation. You will want to work with a functional medicine provider to address any deficiencies \(see step 7\).)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1]
>>
