/E (Tongue tone refers to how strong the tongue is. It needs to be strong enough to rest on the roof of the mouth both day and night. A myofunctional therapist helps to resolve this issue by giving you exercises to do at home that strengthen the muscles of the tongue, cheek, and face. )
