<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Lactation consultants are usually the first people to diagnose tongue/lip/buccal restrictions in infants and can help parents build a team of providers. Sometimes, this just includes craniosacral therapists and chiropractors. But if a tongue release procedure is needed, then it is imperative to continue using a lactation consultant after the procedure to make sure the child is getting enough milk and to help retrain sucking patterns. )
/Pg 55 0 R
/K [1]
