/E (What was my diagnosis? Occlusal disease. What did I do? Thanks to a little device I use in my office called a Kois Deprogrammer, I was able to identify the exact cause of the occlusal disease, treat it, and BAM! Her pain went away. This is the magic of functional dentistry. )
