/K [8]
>>
endobj
2101 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Many lifestyle modifications can be made to reduce the severity of gum inflammation. There are also things you can address holistically that will decrease gum inflammation, such as hormone imbalances, as identified in the story above. )
/Pg 73 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
2102 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 3584 0 R
/E (Poor oral hygiene techniques leads to plaque and bacteria settling deep into the gum tissues where they ultimately will not be reachable by floss or toothbrush.)
/Pg 73 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
2103 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 3585 0 R
/E (Certain medications, such as Phenytoin \(an anti-seizure medication\) and calcium-channel blockers used for lowering blood pressure, can cause drug-induced gingival overgrowth. This overgrowth can trap bacteria and plaque, which can lead to gum inflammation. )
/Pg 73 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
2104 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
