/E (Unfortunately, no product or supplement will magically regrow your gum tissue. All the treatments so far require some sort of surgery. )
/Pg 81 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
2237 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The most common option for replacing missing gum tissue is a gum graft surgery from a periodontist. The gum graft is either taken from the roof of the mouth or a cadaver and placed over the exposed tooth roots \(photo\). Recovery usually takes 1-2 weeks. Gum grafts with your own tissue are more successful than cadaver grafts.)
/Pg 81 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
