2240 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Then, they use specialized instruments to loosen and reposition the gum tissue over the exposed areas of the teeth. Collagen strips may also be placed to help hold the tissue in place and speed up healing. One study showed overall root coverage of 96.7% after 6-month follow-up with minimal complications \(Reddy, 2017\). )
/Pg 81 0 R
/K [7]
>>
