2314 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Dental anxiety is very distressing to the patient and can lead them to neglect their oral health, which affects their overall health. This is described as the vicious cycle of dental anxiety. Oral health can increase symptoms of oral health \(Berggen, 2004\).)
/Pg 85 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
2315 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Current research suggests not only a connection between gut dysbiosis \(unhealthy diversity of gut bacteria\) and feelings of anxiety and depression but that the health of the bacteria in the mouth is also an influential factor. )
/Pg 85 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
