2328 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We want you to know that there are comfort measures for you to help you decrease your dental anxiety, regardless of your level of anxiety or where you are on your journey to healing. Begin by communicating with your dentist or a supportive team member that you experience dental anxiety and ask if they can note this in your chart so the clinical team is aware. Let them know how much you appreciate their help. Remember that you are the patient as well as the paying customer. If you receive pushback for your request for reasonable accommodations, it may be best to find a different dental office that will happily support you. )
/Pg 86 0 R
/K [91]
>>
