<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Third-party financing companies such as Care Credit, Alphaeon, and Cherry make it easier for you to get the treatments you need by allowing you to pay for them over a period of 12-36 months interest-free. We have found that many people shy away from these plans because they do a credit check, but it is a great option for larger treatment plans. My favorite plan is Alphaeon. They have higher acceptance rates, are easy to work with, and give extended 0% financing options. Be sure to pay it off before the period ends, or you will be charged a very large interest fee.)
/Pg 95 0 R
/K [8]
>>
