2554 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The first thing you need to do is take care of emergencies such as abscessed teeth, severe decay, or infection. Then, you want to address any inflamed gum tissue because your gums are a direct pathway to the rest of your body and affect your systemic health. Once your gums look healthier, you can begin to work on urgent restorative needs, such as fillings and onlays \(no more crowns\). )
/Pg 98 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
