/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Bitewing X-rays - Bitewing X-rays are a common type of dental X-ray that show the upper and lower back teeth in a single image. They are most helpful to check for cavities and bone levels around the teeth. The radiation from a single image is comparable to the radiation you get from consuming a banana.)
/E (Bitewing X-rays - Bitewing X-rays are a common type of dental X-ray that show the upper and lower back teeth in a single image. They are most helpful to check for cavities and bone levels around the teeth. The radiation from a single image is comparable to the radiation you get from consuming a banana.)
/Pg 102 0 R
/K [2]
>>
