2607 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Considering the risk of frequent fluoride exposure, I recommend daily products without fluoride \(like Elementa and GC Tooth Mousse\). But, if someone is at a very high risk of cavities, I recommend considering an in-office fluoride varnish treatment twice per year, as it is more effective than daily products, as the science shows that it helps lower the risk of caries. This is a personal decision that should be respected. )
/E (Considering the risk of frequent fluoride exposure, I recommend daily products without fluoride \(like Elementa and GC Tooth Mousse\). But, if someone is at a very high risk of cavities, I recommend considering an in-office fluoride varnish treatment twice per year, as it is more effective than daily products, as the science shows that it helps lower the risk of caries. This is a personal decision that should be respected. )
